                    </div>
                    <p className="m-0 pt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
                      Orbits in the electron cloud; its mass is about 1/1837 of
                      a proton.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div className="rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-800/60 bg-blue-50/50 dark:bg-blue-900/10 p-5">
